# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working notes and agent configuration.
#
# Not part of the library, not part of the Atlas front end, and not part of
# the published record. Kept on disk, untracked on purpose. Restore with
# `git add -f`, remove again with `git rm --cached`. Do not delete.
#
# apps/atlas itself IS published, including its assets, its product brief
# and its changelog. Only these paths are held back.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.opencode/
journal.md
Marketing.md
plan_of_action.md
codex_prompt.md
SKILLS.md
AGENTS.md
apps/atlas/AGENTS.md
docs/strategy_*.md
docs/landscape_and_roadmap.md

# Genuinely local: caches, build output, and datasets too large to host.